## _shcl (zsh completion)
##
##	Tab completion for the shcl CLI. Installed as
##	<datadir>/zsh/site-functions/_shcl, or dropped anywhere on $fpath.
##
##	The option table below mirrors check_opts() in the CLI, one arm per
##	subcommand; the table itself (not the zsh machinery around it) is kept
##	line-for-line identical with the bash completion's.
##	cicd/utility/check-completions.bash diffs all three tables, and the
##	top-level offers, so an option added to the CLI without a line here fails
##	the build.
#••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••

